(6145097, 906201, 103032, '<td valign="top">The perspective makes this pic interesting.  Perhaps crop even closer to the top of the bottles if that was possible; that''s the only critique I have that would make this a stronger image for this viewer.</td>', 'The perspective makes this pic interesting.  Perhaps crop even closer to the top of the bottles if that was possible; that''s the only critique I have that would make this a stronger image for this viewer.', '2010-08-30 03:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145105, 906299, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the idea/concept, but the farthest shadows (last two) kind of gets lost in the distance.  Perhaps a portrait crop instead of square crop would have kept the farthest (last two) bollards more part of the image/subject matter.  But then again, maybe there were things beyond the last bollard that kept that from happening.  Like your choice to go B&amp;W.  Good effort though.</td>', 'I like the idea/concept, but the farthest shadows (last two) kind of gets lost in the distance.  Perhaps a portrait crop instead of square crop would have kept the farthest (last two) bollards more part of the image/subject matter.  But then again, maybe there were things beyond the last bollard that kept that from happening.  Like your choice to go B&W.  Good effort though.', '2010-08-30 03:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
