(6145405, 906072, 77543, '<td valign="top">I like it. There are only five dots on the tie though :-)<br/>I''d have given it a higher score if all the pencils were the same way up.</td>', 'I like it. There are only five dots on the tie though :-)I''d have given it a higher score if all the pencils were the same way up.', '2010-08-30 11:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145428, 906246, 10785, '<td valign="top">Challenge: Take a photograph which contains exactly seven of the main subject.<br/> <br/>Entry: two dice, one waterdrop and a background does not equal seven.</td>', 'Challenge: Take a photograph which contains exactly seven of the main subject. Entry: two dice, one waterdrop and a background does not equal seven.', '2010-08-30 12:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145429, 906042, 101702, '<td valign="top">Hmm... is the main subject the cake? If so, shouldn''t there be seven of them? Or is the main subject the tenners... in which case there are 8 of those. Unless it''s the 10p''s.... of which I see 9. Either way, I''m thinking it DNMC.</td>', 'Hmm... is the main subject the cake? If so, shouldn''t there be seven of them? Or is the main subject the tenners... in which case there are 8 of those. Unless it''s the 10p''s.... of which I see 9. Either way, I''m thinking it DNMC.', '2010-08-30 12:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145433, 906246, 101702, '<td valign="top">Shoehorn. There is supposed to be 7 of the main subject - either the main subject is the droplet, or the dice. Either way there is not 7 of either. DNMC in my opinion.</td>', 'Shoehorn. There is supposed to be 7 of the main subject - either the main subject is the droplet, or the dice. Either way there is not 7 of either. DNMC in my opinion.', '2010-08-30 12:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145453, 906296, 101702, '<td valign="top">Err.. I only make that 6 subjects :-)</td>', 'Err.. I only make that 6 subjects :-)', '2010-08-30 12:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145455, 905968, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph with lots of interest. However - "take a photograph which contains exactly 7 of the main subject". The main subject looks to be the view of the construction... even if the main subject were a window, there would be 49 of them. Unless the subject is 1 row of 7 windows? Either way... no clear link to the challenge at hand in my view.</td>', 'Nice photograph with lots of interest. However - "take a photograph which contains exactly 7 of the main subject". The main subject looks to be the view of the construction... even if the main subject were a window, there would be 49 of them. Unless the subject is 1 row of 7 windows? Either way... no clear link to the challenge at hand in my view.', '2010-08-30 12:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145463, 906100, 10785, '<td valign="top">It looks like you used a real shallow depth of field to blur out the bckground, but it served to shorten up your focal length for the plane of focus your subject was on causing the bottom leaf to be oof as well. It was a good use of selective focus, but I''d like to see that one plane of focus be all in focus.</td>', 'It looks like you used a real shallow depth of field to blur out the bckground, but it served to shorten up your focal length for the plane of focus your subject was on causing the bottom leaf to be oof as well. It was a good use of selective focus, but I''d like to see that one plane of focus be all in focus.', '2010-08-30 12:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145466, 906186, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice find... The whole photo has a blue cast to it suggesting an incorrect white balance setting.</td>', 'Nice find... The whole photo has a blue cast to it suggesting an incorrect white balance setting.', '2010-08-30 12:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145468, 905531, 10785, '<td valign="top">Though a very serious subject, suicide is just not something I want to see explored in photography.</td>', 'Though a very serious subject, suicide is just not something I want to see explored in photography.', '2010-08-30 12:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145476, 906143, 117534, '<td valign="top">WOW JUST WOW blows my socks off!!!</td>', 'WOW JUST WOW blows my socks off!!!', '2010-08-30 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145534, 906066, 112292, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colors. Well done. 8</td>', 'Nice use of colors. Well done. 8', '2010-08-30 14:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145535, 905424, 112292, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like it.</td>', 'Nice idea. I like it.', '2010-08-30 14:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145538, 906143, 112292, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite entries in this challenge. 9</td>', 'One of my favorite entries in this challenge. 9', '2010-08-30 14:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145547, 906245, 115307, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and composition of this photo. However, to me it lacks focus. Its actually odd, because the image appears soft to me even though the pencils clearly are in focus.<br/>Have you tried sharpening after sizing the image for the web? If not, this might be why</td>', 'I like the colors and composition of this photo. However, to me it lacks focus. Its actually odd, because the image appears soft to me even though the pencils clearly are in focus.Have you tried sharpening after sizing the image for the web? If not, this might be why', '2010-08-30 14:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145549, 905724, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. The composition, colors, and mood are just perfect. I really can''t think of anything to improve on.<br/>I am trying to figure out how this was achieved. Clearly the marbles are a little submerged in water, but what is creating that lovely texture underneath? Is it sand?<br/>Anyways, very well done! 9</td>', 'This is a beautiful image. The composition, colors, and mood are just perfect. I really can''t think of anything to improve on.I am trying to figure out how this was achieved. Clearly the marbles are a little submerged in water, but what is creating that lovely texture underneath? Is it sand?Anyways, very well done! 9', '2010-08-30 14:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145552, 905125, 115307, '<td valign="top">This image is very nice. Especially the butterflies eyes and its general color is very interesting.<br/>However, I do think that for the challenge it is somewhat of a stretch. I would never have gotten it without the title, and at least to me legs, tongues, antennas are distinctly different things.<br/>I am going to give this a 6 for image quality.</td>', 'This image is very nice. Especially the butterflies eyes and its general color is very interesting.However, I do think that for the challenge it is somewhat of a stretch. I would never have gotten it without the title, and at least to me legs, tongues, antennas are distinctly different things.I am going to give this a 6 for image quality.', '2010-08-30 14:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145554, 906230, 115307, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the challenge. The slanted angle makes a nice composition and I like the contrast between the green and brown. However, your subject matter is somewhat boring to me. I find that I keep staring at the leaves rather than the bark, because the background is more visually pleasing for me.</td>', 'This certainly meets the challenge. The slanted angle makes a nice composition and I like the contrast between the green and brown. However, your subject matter is somewhat boring to me. I find that I keep staring at the leaves rather than the bark, because the background is more visually pleasing for me.', '2010-08-30 14:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145555, 906192, 115307, '<td valign="top">The background is sort of a yellowy white rather than a true white (at least in my monitor). I think this image would have been more effective if you had made it a true white. The black thing in the orange cup is also distracting.<br/>Other than that, I do think this meets the challenge well and has a nice composition.</td>', 'The background is sort of a yellowy white rather than a true white (at least in my monitor). I think this image would have been more effective if you had made it a true white. The black thing in the orange cup is also distracting.Other than that, I do think this meets the challenge well and has a nice composition.', '2010-08-30 14:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145558, 906202, 115307, '<td valign="top">To me this looks like you combined several hummingbirds into one picture. It seems too coincidental that 7 hummingbirds would come to a feeder at once (especially since they are territorial and tend to chase others away from their food sources). However, I will rate this as if it were completely legit, and let the SC validate or disqualify it. 7</td>', 'To me this looks like you combined several hummingbirds into one picture. It seems too coincidental that 7 hummingbirds would come to a feeder at once (especially since they are territorial and tend to chase others away from their food sources). However, I will rate this as if it were completely legit, and let the SC validate or disqualify it. 7', '2010-08-30 14:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145559, 906235, 115307, '<td valign="top">Both the composition and the tonal range of the black and white image is visually pleasing. I only have the tiniest nitpick in that the obvious carpet underneath bugs me. But other than that I really like it, especially the great detail throughout the image. What made you choose the word elation over other 7 lettered words? Just curious 7</td>', 'Both the composition and the tonal range of the black and white image is visually pleasing. I only have the tiniest nitpick in that the obvious carpet underneath bugs me. But other than that I really like it, especially the great detail throughout the image. What made you choose the word elation over other 7 lettered words? Just curious 7', '2010-08-30 14:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145562, 906255, 115307, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, this looks good. I would eat this ice cream! I love the detail you have managed to capture in the various textures of the different types of ice cream. I would have loved to see the whole cone though. Take that with a grain of salt, because I also understand that that would have made the image incredibly tall and difficult to fit all of that in one picture.</td>', 'Mmmm, this looks good. I would eat this ice cream! I love the detail you have managed to capture in the various textures of the different types of ice cream. I would have loved to see the whole cone though. Take that with a grain of salt, because I also understand that that would have made the image incredibly tall and difficult to fit all of that in one picture.', '2010-08-30 14:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145564, 906202, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ribbon!   I love it!<br/> <br/>(But, with advance editing, I''d have removed the odd darkness in the background ... by the bird far right)  (not voting anyway, so it doesn''t matter what I think.  *grin* )</td>', 'Ribbon!   I love it! (But, with advance editing, I''d have removed the odd darkness in the background ... by the bird far right)  (not voting anyway, so it doesn''t matter what I think.  *grin* )', '2010-08-30 14:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
