(6145570, 905780, 115307, '<td valign="top">I like the editing that you have done with this image. The concept/title is also clever.<br/>The only thing that bothers me is that the 7th grave is not in the same row as the rest. This makes it inferior in a way. 6 graves share importance and the 7th lurks in the background. However, I am also conflicted because I also believe that that makes the composition more interesting. Just take what I said with a grain of salt. 6</td>', 'I like the editing that you have done with this image. The concept/title is also clever.The only thing that bothers me is that the 7th grave is not in the same row as the rest. This makes it inferior in a way. 6 graves share importance and the 7th lurks in the background. However, I am also conflicted because I also believe that that makes the composition more interesting. Just take what I said with a grain of salt. 6', '2010-08-30 14:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
