(6145584, 905531, 115307, '<td valign="top">Dpc doesn''t tend to vote nicely on conceptual shots, which is really too bad. This is really well done and I love how you chose a strong tilt. It really makes the image more powerful. Besides some blown out highlights, there are no flaws in this image. If someone doesn''t like it, it is due to their personal taste in photography and not due to any photographic shortcomings. 7</td>', 'Dpc doesn''t tend to vote nicely on conceptual shots, which is really too bad. This is really well done and I love how you chose a strong tilt. It really makes the image more powerful. Besides some blown out highlights, there are no flaws in this image. If someone doesn''t like it, it is due to their personal taste in photography and not due to any photographic shortcomings. 7', '2010-08-30 15:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
