(6145729, 906300, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hello little froggie!  Beautiful composition.  I love how you caught him mid-motion.  I want to know where he''s going, or perhaps he''s wondering what the heck these octogons are, and why he''s on them :-)  Might have boosted the color on him just a wee bit.</td>', 'Hello little froggie!  Beautiful composition.  I love how you caught him mid-motion.  I want to know where he''s going, or perhaps he''s wondering what the heck these octogons are, and why he''s on them :-)  Might have boosted the color on him just a wee bit.', '2010-08-30 16:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145732, 906202, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful.  It looks like one of those botanical illustrations.  Marvelous processing and I''m wondering how you achieved the pure white bg, although I imagine you might have used some sort of large sheet or posterboard.  Perfectly processed.  Many kudos for capturing SEVEN of them in focus. Front page.</td>', 'This is so beautiful.  It looks like one of those botanical illustrations.  Marvelous processing and I''m wondering how you achieved the pure white bg, although I imagine you might have used some sort of large sheet or posterboard.  Perfectly processed.  Many kudos for capturing SEVEN of them in focus. Front page.', '2010-08-30 16:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145733, 906151, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting.  Well modulated and processed.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting.  Well modulated and processed.', '2010-08-30 16:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145734, 906234, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  Nicely stopped.</td>', 'Great action shot.  Nicely stopped.', '2010-08-30 16:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145735, 905643, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wild colors!</td>', 'Wild colors!', '2010-08-30 16:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145736, 906097, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice formation.  Love the pov and processing.</td>', 'Nice formation.  Love the pov and processing.', '2010-08-30 16:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145739, 905531, 96751, '<td valign="top">Good story image.  A little disturbing, but well crafted.</td>', 'Good story image.  A little disturbing, but well crafted.', '2010-08-30 16:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145741, 906179, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous action shot.  Incredible formation.  It almost looks like the same person as he goes from standing to jumping.  Not wild about the red ball...</td>', 'Fabulous action shot.  Incredible formation.  It almost looks like the same person as he goes from standing to jumping.  Not wild about the red ball...', '2010-08-30 17:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145743, 906145, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very clever and well done.  Wonderful processing.  I love the contrast of the grunge on the face and the clean metal of the edge.  Beautiful.  Front page.</td>', 'Very clever and well done.  Wonderful processing.  I love the contrast of the grunge on the face and the clean metal of the edge.  Beautiful.  Front page.', '2010-08-30 17:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145744, 906251, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very artistic.  Are those sunflower seeds?  Or grape seeds?</td>', 'Very artistic.  Are those sunflower seeds?  Or grape seeds?', '2010-08-30 17:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145745, 906072, 96751, '<td valign="top">This stood out for being so different from the rest.  Very corporate yet quirky.  Nicely lit and processed.</td>', 'This stood out for being so different from the rest.  Very corporate yet quirky.  Nicely lit and processed.', '2010-08-30 17:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145747, 906191, 96751, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS!!!!  I love this image.  The colors, the reflections, the concept.  Even the smoke is wonderful.  I''m a bit on the fense about the composition, thinking that the negative space on the left does not do much to help the image.  Front page.</td>', 'GORGEOUS!!!!  I love this image.  The colors, the reflections, the concept.  Even the smoke is wonderful.  I''m a bit on the fense about the composition, thinking that the negative space on the left does not do much to help the image.  Front page.', '2010-08-30 17:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145748, 906186, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen.  Clever title.  I just love the simple lines and perfect processing.  I wonder if he really thinks he''s blending in.  Front page.</td>', 'Nicely seen.  Clever title.  I just love the simple lines and perfect processing.  I wonder if he really thinks he''s blending in.  Front page.', '2010-08-30 17:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145756, 906222, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo of flowers and I love the lovely textures that are represented both in the petals, leaves, and wall texture. Its like I could reach through the screen and feel it myself.<br/>However, it is extremely difficult to spot all 7 flowers, which is a bit of a downer since that is the main point of this challenge. Maybe a slightly higher angle would have made the back flowers more obvious. 6</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo of flowers and I love the lovely textures that are represented both in the petals, leaves, and wall texture. Its like I could reach through the screen and feel it myself.However, it is extremely difficult to spot all 7 flowers, which is a bit of a downer since that is the main point of this challenge. Maybe a slightly higher angle would have made the back flowers more obvious. 6', '2010-08-30 17:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145758, 905571, 115307, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image and perfect for this challenge. This is exposed perfectly, which is not easy to do with flames! I also love the rich tones and of course the concept.<br/>Personally, I don''t like the splotches of wax on the table. I get why it was done, in order to show the decrease in stature of the candles, but to me it is distracting. Because that is personal preference though, I won''t deduct anything from the score. I will not be surprised at all to see this pretty high up top. 8</td>', 'Fantastic image and perfect for this challenge. This is exposed perfectly, which is not easy to do with flames! I also love the rich tones and of course the concept.Personally, I don''t like the splotches of wax on the table. I get why it was done, in order to show the decrease in stature of the candles, but to me it is distracting. Because that is personal preference though, I won''t deduct anything from the score. I will not be surprised at all to see this pretty high up top. 8', '2010-08-30 17:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145760, 906069, 115307, '<td valign="top">My first thought when I saw this image was "Psychedelic"<br/>The two gummy bears in front are soft compared to the others which are much more in focus. I would have liked to see them just as in focus.</td>', 'My first thought when I saw this image was "Psychedelic"The two gummy bears in front are soft compared to the others which are much more in focus. I would have liked to see them just as in focus.', '2010-08-30 17:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145761, 906114, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the texture of the surface that the marbles are resting on. However, I think a larger depth of field would have been necessary for this to be effective. I would have liked to see all of the marbles in equal focus</td>', 'I love the colors and the texture of the surface that the marbles are resting on. However, I think a larger depth of field would have been necessary for this to be effective. I would have liked to see all of the marbles in equal focus', '2010-08-30 17:35:13.000000', NULL, 1);
