(6145983, 906181, 115307, '<td valign="top">The composition and colors of this image are very visually pleasing. I quite like it. It is especially nice that all of the bird houses look distinctly different. That gives the viewer a lot to look at. <br/>I do think that the sticker thing with the number 7 is completely unnecessary. It doesn''t fit with the mood of the rest of the photograph 7</td>', 'The composition and colors of this image are very visually pleasing. I quite like it. It is especially nice that all of the bird houses look distinctly different. That gives the viewer a lot to look at. I do think that the sticker thing with the number 7 is completely unnecessary. It doesn''t fit with the mood of the rest of the photograph 7', '2010-08-30 21:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6145992, 905761, 115307, '<td valign="top">To me the background is too cluttered. It draws the eye away from the crosses. Otherwise, good composition and I like how the bursts of color in the flowers stands out from the dull environment,</td>', 'To me the background is too cluttered. It draws the eye away from the crosses. Otherwise, good composition and I like how the bursts of color in the flowers stands out from the dull environment,', '2010-08-30 21:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6146008, 905752, 73942, '<td valign="top">that''s just precious</td>', 'that''s just precious', '2010-08-30 21:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6146019, 905968, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and very fascinating too but 7X7 = 49 and the requirement was that the QUOTE"photograph contains exactly seven of the main subject."UNQUOTE<br/>Not 7x7 or 7+7, no just 7.<br/>Difficult to say what the main subject here is, is it the window frame? If it is there is 1 window frame divided into 49 individual panes not 7. Or are the buildings the main subject? or the construction cranes? or the cars? hey, there are 7 cars by the way but I guess you could hardly call them the main subject.<br/>Sorry....rules are rules. 3</td>', 'Very nice image and very fascinating too but 7X7 = 49 and the requirement was that the QUOTE"photograph contains exactly seven of the main subject."UNQUOTENot 7x7 or 7+7, no just 7.Difficult to say what the main subject here is, is it the window frame? If it is there is 1 window frame divided into 49 individual panes not 7. Or are the buildings the main subject? or the construction cranes? or the cars? hey, there are 7 cars by the way but I guess you could hardly call them the main subject.Sorry....rules are rules. 3', '2010-08-30 21:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
