(6150727, 906100, 71239, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp pattern shot with the leaves symmetrical and backlit for interest.  A little more depth of field required to prevent the bottom leaf drifting out of focus.</td>', 'Nice crisp pattern shot with the leaves symmetrical and backlit for interest.  A little more depth of field required to prevent the bottom leaf drifting out of focus.', '2010-09-03 05:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150728, 906103, 71239, '<td valign="top">Reflective objects are a real nightmare to light and unfortunately here the two big softboxes have left rather distracting highlights in the spoon bowls whilst the delicate detail in the handles has been lost in places.  Maybe going the whole way to either a light tent or right back to a point light source would help.</td>', 'Reflective objects are a real nightmare to light and unfortunately here the two big softboxes have left rather distracting highlights in the spoon bowls whilst the delicate detail in the handles has been lost in places.  Maybe going the whole way to either a light tent or right back to a point light source would help.', '2010-09-03 05:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6150730, 906246, 71239, '<td valign="top">Nice timing on the water droplet, a pity it is out of focus as it is the thing that draws the eye.  You do seem to be missing seven main subjects too.</td>', 'Nice timing on the water droplet, a pity it is out of focus as it is the thing that draws the eye.  You do seem to be missing seven main subjects too.', '2010-09-03 06:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
