(6150753, 905797, 6519, '<td valign="top">Love it! (9)<br/> <br/>About the type of light you used for this:<br/>Most of the time we would call it "harsh" because of the strength, the angles and the resulting shadows.<br/>Yet here, I think it is wonderful..... it simply wouldn''t have the same impact with soft diffused light.<br/> <br/>Isn''t it interesting how it always "depends"  :-)</td>', 'Love it! (9) About the type of light you used for this:Most of the time we would call it "harsh" because of the strength, the angles and the resulting shadows.Yet here, I think it is wonderful..... it simply wouldn''t have the same impact with soft diffused light. Isn''t it interesting how it always "depends"  :-)', '2010-09-03 07:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
