(6152006, 905968, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting. This is a devious example of dealing with "7" as a concept, but the challenge asked us to show 7 of the main subject, and even IF you call the panes of glass the "subject" you have 49 of ''em, so at a fundamental level this isn''t meeting the challenge, or doing so only very obliquely.<br/> <br/>Nevertheless, it''s a fine image and I''m giving you a respectable score.</td>', 'It''s interesting. This is a devious example of dealing with "7" as a concept, but the challenge asked us to show 7 of the main subject, and even IF you call the panes of glass the "subject" you have 49 of ''em, so at a fundamental level this isn''t meeting the challenge, or doing so only very obliquely. Nevertheless, it''s a fine image and I''m giving you a respectable score.', '2010-09-04 17:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
